{"id":"664641","name":"西蓝花拌虾仁","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/664641/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西蓝花","amount":"1棵"},{"name":"冷冻生南美白虾","amount":"9只"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"青椒","amount":"少许"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"冷冻生南美白虾，把虾去壳去线，清洗干净。","img":"images/664641/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"焯一下水。","img":"images/664641/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"捞出，过凉水，再捞出，备用。","img":"images/664641/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"西蓝花切成小朵，淘洗干净。","img":"images/664641/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅里加点油，焯水2分钟。","img":"images/664641/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捞出，过凉水，再捞出，沥干水分，放入盆中，备用。","img":"images/664641/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煮好的鸡蛋，备用。","img":"images/664641/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"切好。","img":"images/664641/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"蒜沫和青椒碎，备用。","img":"images/664641/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"蒜沫和青椒碎热油爆香，加少许生抽、耗油和香醋。","img":"images/664641/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"西蓝花和虾仁放入盆中。","img":"images/664641/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再放入切好的鸡蛋。","img":"images/664641/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"淋上灵魂妙汁。","img":"images/664641/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"搅拌一下。","img":"images/664641/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"好吃又营养。","img":"images/664641/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}